{"id":"1eb2bd3bd0214732","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-automorphism.md","title":"Automorphism","display":"df-automorphism — Automorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-automorphism","aliases":["58-df-automorphism"],"display":"df-automorphism — Automorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-automorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-automorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-automorphism — Automorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(f,X,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S\\)</span> (isomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (automorphism predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,X,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,X,X,\\sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,X,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,X,X,\\sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Automorphisms are isomorphisms from an object to itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"01f4b76e2e096590","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"01f4b76e2e096590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_S$ (isomorphism predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,X,\\sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aut}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,X,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,X,X,\\sigma)","display":true}],"bytes":652,"backlinks":[{"id":"bcbbb5818d2f6100","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Aut}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]])"},{"id":"21aca82552a5a872","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Aut}_S$ (自同构谓词, see [[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]])"},{"id":"dac0596ff0a0af4a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,K,\\sigma_K)$ (automorphism predicate, see [[58-df-automorphism]])"},{"id":"b866d5d6df9ca9cd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-automorphism]